---
// Walkable St. Louis corridor figures. The article's markdown supplies one
// placeholder per strip (`<div class="corridor-map" data-corridor-map="<id>"></div>`);
// this component only ships the script that mounts the maps into them.
// [slug].astro includes it when the topic's body contains a placeholder, so
// other topics never load MapLibre.
---

<script>
  import { initCorridorMaps } from '../scripts/corridor-map'
  initCorridorMaps()
</script>
